cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
title: "aco-tsp: ant colony optimisation for the travelling salesman problem"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Palahin
    given-names: Dmytro
version: 2.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-13"
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/DmytroPalahin/aco-tsp
abstract: >-
  A C11 library and command-line tool that solve the symmetric travelling
  salesman problem with Ant System, optionally combined with elitist
  reinforcement, greedy exploitation and 2-opt local search. Includes
  reference solvers, a TSPLIB reader and a reproducible experimental study.
keywords:
  - ant colony optimization
  - travelling salesman problem
  - metaheuristics
  - combinatorial optimization
  - C
